Package: spatialHVI
Title: Spatial Heritability Variational Inference for Imaging Genetics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "yytyyt11",
           family = "Maintainer",
           email = "819826397@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities for simulation, fast variational
    inference fitting, and heritability summaries under a Bayesian spatial
    heritability model for halves-ordered left and right trait pairs in
    imaging genetics and related multivariate settings.
